00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.170
'cause I wanna like,

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.497
I like looking taller and
the whole thing but now-

00:00:51.497 --> 00:00:53.550
- You do feel sexy in a stiletto.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.900
- You do totally, and your posture too.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.510
'Cause I have like really bad posture,

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.600
so sometimes I'm like...
- Me too.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.023
- I'm either like this on stage-

00:01:00.023 --> 00:01:01.240
- Yeah, it's always my butt.
- Or like this-

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.230
